</main>
<main id="vAcc" hidden>
<div class="imp">
  <div class="panel"><h2>Access list</h2>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:0">Only emails on this list can sign up and sign in. Admins can manage this list and import dealer data; Users can view the map and dashboards. Removing an email blocks that person immediately.</p>
    <textarea id="aAdd" rows="3" placeholder="name@vf.om — one per line or separated by commas" aria-label="Emails to add"></textarea>
